// Hello: the first program.
//
// A program starts at `main()`. `println` writes its argument and a line
// break to standard output, and `${...}` inside a string puts a value
// there. A line ends a statement: there are no semicolons.
//
// Run: ae run examples/01-language/01-hello.ae
// See: docs/language-reference.md#functions

main() {
    println("Hello, Aether!")
    name = "world"
    println("Hello, ${name}.")
}

// Output:
// Hello, Aether!
// Hello, world.
